              Specifies the organization responsible for the clean-up of a material that was released during an incident.\n* 1022  | Contact Person Party \n              Specifies the person who can be contacted.\n* 1023  | Corporate Manager Party\n              Specifies the person who is the corporate manager.\n* 1024  | Disposal Company Party\n              Specifies the organization responsible for the disposal of a material that was recovered, for example, after a release.\n* 1025  | Emergency Responder Party\n              Specifies the emergency services provider, for example, the police or an ambulance.\n* 1026  | Environmental Compliance Manager Party\n              Specifies the person responsible for managing an organization's environmental compliance responsibilities.\n* 1027  | Equipment Operator Party\n              Specifies the person who operates a piece of equipment.\n* 1028  | Financial Transaction Remittee / Payer Party\n              Specifies the person who pays for a financial transaction.\n* 1033  | NOV Issuer Party\n              Specifies the organization that issued the notice of violation (NOV).\n* 1034  | Observed Person Party \n              Specifies the person who was observed as part of a safety observation.\n* 1039  | Reporting Person Party\n              Specifies the person who initially reported the incident.\n* 1040  | Supervisor Party\n              Specifies the person who is responsible for supervising employees.\n* 1041  | Vehicle Driver Party\n              Specifies the person who was driving the vehicle at the time of the incident.\n* 1042  | Vehicle Insurer Party\n              Specifies the person or organization that insures a vehicle.\n* 1043  | Vehicle Owner Party\n              Specifies the person or organization that owns a vehicle.\n* 1044  | Vehicle Passenger Party\n              Specifies the person who was riding in the vehicle at the time of the incident.\n* 1101  | Invoicing Unit Party\n              Invoicing Unit Synonym for Bill From Party\n* 1122  | Contract Administrator\n              A party that handles contract processing.\n",
