iner With Ventilation, * 22V2 - 20 Feet General Purpose Container With Ventilation, * 22V3 - 20 Feet General Purpose Container With Ventilation, * 25G0 - 20 Feet General Purpose Container High Cube, * 26G0 - 20 Feet General Purpose Container Over-Height, * 26H0 - 20 Feet Insulated Container, * 28T8 - 20 Feet Tank for Gas, * 28U1 - 20 Feet Open Top (Half Height), * 28V0 - 20 Feet General Purpose Container With Ventilation, * 29P0 - 20 Feet Platform, * 2EG0 - 20 Feet High Cube Container (Width 2.5M), * 42G0 - 40 Feet General Purpose Container Without Ventilation, * 42G1 - 40 Feet General Purpose Container Without Ventilation, * 42H0 - 40 Feet Insulated Container, * 42P3 - 40 Feet Flat (Collapsible), * 42P8 - 40 Feet Flat (Collapsible Flush Folding), * 42P9 - 40 Feet Flat (Collapsible), * 42P1 - 40 Feet Flat (Fixed Ends), * 42P6 - 40 Feet Flat Space Saver, * 42R9 - 40 Feet Self Powered Reefer Container (No Food), * 42R3 - 40 Feet Self Powered Reefer Container (Diesel Gen.), * 42R1 - 40 Feet Reefer Container, * 42S1 - 40 Feet Named Cargo Container, * 42T5 - 40 Feet Tank Container for Dangerous Liquids, * 42T6 - 40 Feet Tank Container for Dangerous Liquids, * 42T8 - 40 Feet Tank Container for Gases, * 42T2 - 40 Feet Tank Container for Nondangerous Liquids, * 42U6 - 40 Feet Hardtop Container, * 42U1 - 40 Feet Open Top Container, * 45B3 - 40 Feet Bulk Container, * 45G0 - 40 Feet High Cube Container, * 45G1 - 40 Feet High Cube Container, * 45P3 - 40 Feet Flat (Collapsible), * 45P8 - 40 Feet Flat (Collapsible Flush Folding), * 45R9 - 40 Feet Reefer Container (No Food), * 45R1 - 40 Feet Reefer Highcube Container, * 45U1 - 40 Feet Open Top Container, * 45U6 - 40 Feet High Cube Hardtop Container, * 46H0 - 40 Feet Insulated Container, * 48T8 - 40 Feet Tank for Gas, * 49P0 - 40 Feet Platform, * 4CG0 - 40 Feet GP Container (Width 2.5m), * L0G1 - 45 Feet High Cube Container, * L2G1 - 45 Feet High Cube Container, * L5G1 - 45 Feet High Cube Container For more, see the Code Lists document https://help.sap.com/docs/business-network-freight-collaboration/code-lists/container-types",
